  "notes": [
   "The Certificate of Achievement section states 42 units of Required Courses and 6 units of Major Electives 'listed under the Associate degree in Electrical Construction and Maintenance: Electrician'; the course lists were therefore read from the A.S. section.",
   "The PLOs are printed once for all Electrical Construction and Maintenance degree/certificate programs ('Upon completion of the Degree/Certificate programs'); this certificate shares that list.",
   "The 'ELECTIVE' rows in the semester sequence (3+1+1+1 = 6 units) are placeholders for the 6 units of Major Electives and are not counted separately.",
